      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive clinicians with front desk critiques"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients express deep gratitude for compassionate veterinarians and technicians like Chloe and Michael, who provide empathetic care, listen attentively to family constraints, and support nervous pets. Conversely, several reviewers share negative feedback regarding support personnel, describing rude reception interactions, slow administrative handling, and occasional lapses during difficult diagnoses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accessible procedures alongside deposit increases"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners widely value the clinic's low-cost options for spay and neuter surgeries, microchipping, and essential puppy vaccinations. At the same time, multiple recent visitors express surprise over increased fees following the move to the new facility, specifically citing seventy-dollar upfront deposit requirements and higher prices for routine medications and parasite treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Persistent phone line access delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Telephone communication is a recurring frustration among reviewers attempting to schedule appointments or inquire about pet services. Multiple clients report prolonged hold times, unanswered calls, unreturned voicemails, and difficulties coordinating through online request forms, leading several owners to visit in person simply to secure a booking."
      }
    }
  ],
